# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Retail game data — NEVER COMMIT. Copyrighted, ~3.8 GB, and publishing it
# would turn a source release into redistribution of the shipped game.
# The port reads it from a folder the user picks at launch; it is not ours.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
FullGame/

# Build output
build/
build-*/
*.xcodeproj/
DerivedData/
*.o
*.obj
*.lto
*.dylib
*.a

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI-facing working notes — MUST NOT APPEAR IN THIS REPO.
# These live OUTSIDE the tree (../NOLF2_Claude/) so they cannot be committed
# by accident; these patterns are the second line of defence, and
# .githooks/pre-commit is the third. See CONTRIBUTING notes in README.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*HANDOFF*.md
*handoff*.md
CONTINUE_PROMPT.md
NEXT_SESSION_PROMPT.md
NEXT_CONTEXT_PROMPT.md
PORT_STATUS.md
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Separate side project — its own repo, not part of the port
CharacterViewer_Metal/
_retired/

# Scratch / junk
failedBuild.txt
*.log
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Launcher background artwork — copyrighted promotional material, supplied
# locally by the user, never redistributed here. Same rule as FullGame/.
# The launcher falls back to a plain background when it is absent.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
launcher/Resources/
